格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness control center for balance, usage, peak/off-peak pricing, encrypted multi-account switching, health checks, reminders, recharge, and session controls. / 余额、用量、峰谷计费、加密多账户、健康检查、提醒、充值与会话控制","id":"gh:1334075920","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"deepseek-harness-control-center","slug":"feibi-mochi/deepseek-harness-control-center","topics":["account-monitoring","agentic-ai","balance-monitor","cost-tracking","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","javascript","llm","notifications","plugin","recharge","session-management","token-tracking","wallet"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness control center for balance, usage, peak/off-peak pricing, encrypted multi-account s"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"witching, health checks, reminders, recharge, and session controls. / 余额、用量、峰谷计费、加密多账户、健康检查、提醒、充值与会话"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"tching, health checks, reminders, recharge, and session controls. / 余额、用量、峰谷计费、加密多账户、健康检查、提醒、充值与会话控制"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DeepSeek Harness Control Center"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness monitoring, alerts, recharge, and session control center.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`Balance ¥5.89 · Session ¥0.72 · Official 18.8M | Third-party 800K · ↗ Recharge`"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · Install · Compatibility · Changelog"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> A local-first companion that keeps account status, per-conversation usage, completion reminders, o"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"fficial recharge, flexible layout, and host-gated session controls beside the DSH composer."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **Version:** v0.3.13."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> If DeepSeek Harness Control Center helps you, please consider leaving a ⭐ Star. Thank you!"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The wallet UI is currently primarily Chinese and does not yet follow the host language setting (#32)"},{"id":"p10s2","text":". DeepSeek balances come from the official API; cost accounting is a local estimate."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Official DeepSeek** — live balance (60s global refresh with fast boot retries), an estimated cur"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"rent-session cost (not an official bill) locked to the price active for each usage event, including "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"the 2026-08-17 peak/off-peak rollout, and token breakdown.\n- **Vision model accounting** — `deepseek"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"-v4-flash-vision-exp` is priced like V4 Flash; image tokens reported by the Harness are included wit"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"h text tokens.\n- **v4 peak/off-peak ring clock** — a resident 24-hour sidebar footer widget for `v4-"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"flash`, `v4-pro`, and `v4-flash-vision-exp`. Weekday peak windows are 09:00–12:00 and 14:00–18:00 Be"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"ijing time. After Friday 18:00 the card previews “weekend all-day off-peak”; Saturday and Sunday nam"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"e the current all-day off-peak rule; Monday before 09:00 shows the time remaining to enter peak. Opt"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"ional notifications treat Friday 18:00 through Monday 09:00 as one continuous off-peak period.\n- **O"},{"id":"p12s10","text":"fficial pricing sync** — periodically checks the official DeepSeek pricing page and applies only a f"},{"id":"p12s11","text":"ully validated table. Network failures retain the last validated rule (or the built-in rule before t"},{"id":"p12s12","text":"he first successful sync); an unrecognized page structure is marked for review instead of silently c"},{"id":"p12s13","text":"hanging billing.\n- **Z.ai Coding Plan quotas** — a generic official-plan adapter monitors configured"},{"id":"p12s14","text":" Global and China plans without exposing credentials. It separates the 5-hour model-token window fro"},{"id":"p12s15","text":"m monthly MCP-tool usage, leads with quota remaining from 100% down while keeping usage as secondary"},{"id":"p12s16","text":" context, retains the last successful snapshot on failure, and never converts subscription quota int"},{"id":"p12s17","text":"o CNY balance.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Multi-account"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- Open the wallet panel → **Account Management（账户管理）** to add accounts (name + API key), switch the "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"active one, or remove them.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Project overview"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Wallet is for users who want to check balances during a conversation, compare model"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" costs, or manage multiple accounts. A chip beside the composer shows the selected model’s balance, "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"remaining plan quota, or token usage; open it for details or detach it into a floating panel. Settin"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"gs brings together encrypted accounts, low-balance and completion reminders, a usage heatmap, and fi"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"xed or time-of-use prices for third-party APIs. DeepSeek balances and Z.ai quotas come from their re"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"spective APIs. Costs are estimated locally from host-reported usage, helping you track consumption w"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"ithout replacing provider invoices."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"From npm:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"or from GitHub `main`:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then hard-refresh the page."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Browser, desktop, and OS compatibility"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"See 0.3.13 compatibility evidence. The official 0.1.5-alpha.1 host does not provide this plugin’s pe"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"rmanent-delete capability, so that switch stays disabled; the old source integration patch is not a "},{"id":"p24s3","text":"capability, so that switch stays disabled; the old source integration patch is not a drop-in update."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The client contains no operating-system-specific feature branch; it checks the Web and host capabili"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ties it needs. That makes the same code portable, but **portable code is not the same as real-device"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"hat makes the same code portable, but **portable code is not the same as real-device verification**:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Verification level | Coverage |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Current local verification | Windows + Node 24.18.1 + DSH 0.1.5-alpha.1; keyless Web UI and isolat"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ed lifecycle checks. No live paid-API acceptance |\n| Exact host coverage | 0.1.5-alpha.1 checked for"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" this update; earlier 0.1.2-alpha.3/alpha.4/alpha.5/rc.1 evidence belongs to previous wallet release"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"s. Other releases remain unverified |\n| Automated compatibility checks | Browser notification failur"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"e, in-page fallback, cross-tab fallback, storage fallback, CSS-scale fallback, and synchronous/async"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"hronous desktop adapters |\n| Capability-compatible targets | Current Chrome, Edge, and Firefox on Wi"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"ndows/macOS/Linux; Safari on macOS; Electron/Tauri-style DSH wrappers that provide the requirements "},{"id":"p27s8","text":"acOS/Linux; Safari on macOS; Electron/Tauri-style DSH wrappers that provide the requirements below |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The last row describes intended compatibility, not a claim that every browser/OS/wrapper combination"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" was physically tested. If system notifications are unavailable or denied, reminders fall back to an"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" in-page notice; if Web Locks are unavailable, a renewable local-storage lease coordinates reminder "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ownership across tabs. CSS `zoom` also has a transform fallback. Core wallet data, controls, draggin"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"g, docking, scaling, and visibility settings use these shared paths rather than an OS name check."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Electron, Tauri, and other DSH desktop wrappers can run the wallet when they expose the normal DSH W"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"eb plugin loader, slots, wallet HTTP endpoints, DOM, and `fetch`. A wrapper that restricts native no"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"tifications, persistent storage, or external links may define one optional adapter before the plugin"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"ersistent storage, or external links may define one optional adapter before the plugin bundle loads:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
